# $name

$description

Scaffolded with `bevel create`. Layout:

```
bevel.yaml          project config (how to render)
configs/<part>.yaml per-part config (what to build)
src/<part>.py       part source: build(cfg) -> CadQuery geometry
renders/            timestamped render bundles (git-ignored)
```

## Render

```bash
bevel list                                    # parts in src/
bevel render <part>                           # -> renders/<part>_<timestamp>/
bevel render <part> --skip preview            # faster loop while iterating
bevel render <part> <part>.some_key=1         # override any config key
bevel render <part> --viewer                  # push to a running cadquery-web-viewer
bevel inspect renders/<bundle>/<bundle>.stl   # watertight / components / open edges
bevel config $part_name                       # show the fully merged config
```

## Add another part

```bash
bevel add <name> --template basic|label
```
